<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued six million European-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said. COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS REFER TO ONE UNDERLYING..</p>
<p> EXPIRTION	 19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	13.DEC.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     $750	  $6.97	 8.57 PCT    10.83 X</p>
<p> PUT	$750	  $3.75	 4.97 PCT    20.13 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
